# The sheet (Blu-rays tab): a link to its CSV export. "Anyone with the link can view" is enough, e.g.
# https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<id>/export?format=csv&gid=0   (a plain sheet link works too)
# Without it, data/blu-rays.csv is used (git-ignored).
SHEET_CSV_URL=
# TMDb v3 API key (https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api) – or a v4 "read access token".
# Without it, only the films already in the TMDb cache (.cache/) get posters, runtimes and directors.
TMDB_API_KEY=
